                        "entry_id": "2517838e-2965-36a1-ae5c-82f953a64d48",
                        "glosses": [
                            "skopets, a member of a Russian religious eunuch movement practising self-castration"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "da55a2e8-beb6-4612-8fea-b7eb190130c1",
                                "sense_id": "431e755e-4c6d-3cb0-be0f-423bcc9d7ad1",
                                "text": "Сам Михей к секте относился иронически, считая скопцов не «белыми голубями», как они себя называли, а воробышками",
                                "translation": "Mikhei himself regarded the sect ironically, considering the eunuchs not “white doves,” as they called themselves, but little sparrows",
                                "english": "Mikhei himself regarded the sect ironically, considering the eunuchs not “white doves,” as they called themselves, but little sparrows"
                            }
                        ]
